@host = http://localhost:5080

### 0. Can the API reach SQL Server? (Exercise 1)
GET {{host}}/health/db

### ---------- GET (slide 16) ----------

### 1. Get all tasks (200 OK, rows come from SQL Server; run scripts/sample-data.sql first, or POST some)
GET {{host}}/api/tasks

### 2. Get one task (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/1

### 3. Task that does not exist (404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/999

### ---------- POST (slides 17-19) ----------

### 4. Create a valid task (201 Created + Location header)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "  Finish Session 10 lab  ",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 5. Priority can also be a number: 1=Low, 2=Medium, 3=High (201)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Number priority",
  "priority": 1
}

### 6. Broken business rule: due date in the past (400 from the SERVICE)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Old task",
  "dueDate": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 7. Broken input rules: empty title (400 from MODEL VALIDATION, before the service runs)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "priority": "High"
}

### 8. Invalid priority value (400 from MODEL VALIDATION)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad priority",
  "priority": 9
}

### ---------- PUT (slide 20) ----------

### 9. Update task 1 (204 No Content, no body)
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task 1 updated through EF Core",
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 10. Verify the update (200, status is now Completed)
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/1

### 11. Rule: a Completed task cannot go back to Pending (400 from the SERVICE)
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task 1 back to pending",
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "Pending"
}

### 12. Update a task that does not exist (404)
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost",
  "priority": "Low",
  "status": "Pending"
}

### ---------- DELETE (slide 21) ----------

### 13. Delete task 2 (204 No Content)
DELETE {{host}}/api/tasks/2

### 14. Delete it again (404, it is already gone)
DELETE {{host}}/api/tasks/2

### 15. Confirm the final list
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
